       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SRCHTBL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 CODES.
          05 FILLER PIC X(5) VALUE "AAAAA".
          05 FILLER PIC X(5) VALUE "BBBBB".
          05 FILLER PIC X(5) VALUE "CCCCC".
       01 TBL REDEFINES CODES.
          05 ENTRY-CODE PIC X(5) OCCURS 3 TIMES INDEXED BY IDX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET IDX TO 1
           SEARCH ENTRY-CODE
               AT END DISPLAY "NOT FOUND"
               WHEN ENTRY-CODE(IDX) = "CCCCC"
                   DISPLAY "FOUND AT " IDX
           END-SEARCH
           STOP RUN.
